# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# GITIGNORE — Memorization / Privacy Auditing Project
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# ONLY src/ is tracked. All data (raw or processed), results, figures,
# logs, and notebooks are excluded to prevent PHI/HIPAA leakage.
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── DATA: Exclude EVERYTHING in data/ to prevent PHI/HIPAA leakage ───────────
# This includes raw records, processed files, model predictions, results,
# summaries, figures, and any intermediate outputs.
data/

# ── Any data-adjacent output directories at project root ─────────────────────
logs/
outputs/
results/
*.jsonl
*.csv
*.parquet
*.pkl
*.h5

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
venv/
env/
.venv/
.env

# ── Local config (API keys, paths) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# DO NOT commit config.py — use config.py.template instead
src/utils/config.py
!src/utils/config.py.template

# ── Jupyter Notebooks ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── OS & editor files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/

# ── Model weights / checkpoints (never commit large binaries) ─────────────────
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.gguf
